:: Felix Spy Intro First [nobr]

/* Intro */
You are careful as you walk down the streets of Avendale, knowing many houses are fitted with security cameras and the front guard’s eyes may be on you, seeing as you are an outsider. However, thanks to your time spent at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>’s house, <span style="Color: LightGreen">you have learned a few things that you can’t help but exploit.</span> You didn’t notice any security cameras at the back of his house and there was a large tree in the backyard that had the perfect view of the window to his bedroom, one with enough leaves to keep you covered. <span style="Color: Yellow">Your heart races as you consider what this could mean.</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Player",
