:: Felix Spy Intro [nobr]

/* Intro */
You follow the path you took the first time you did this, though with more assurance and purpose than before. You pass by a woman in fancy clothing walking her tiny dog, but she doesn’t seem to pay you any mind. Good, this means you look like you belong. Then, without looking too obvious, you turn between the houses and begin to make your way towards the back of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>’s, moving quickly but quietly. <br>

